# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vendor SDK binaries.
#
# BluetoothLibrary.framework is Coolwear/celink proprietary code (SDK built
# 2025-07). Committing a third party's binary into a GitHub repo — even a
# private one — is a licensing decision that is yours to make, not mine, so the
# binaries are excluded here by default.
#
# Everything else in SDK/ (docs, the vendor demo project, headers) is tracked.
# To build the device target, put the framework back:
#
#   SDK/SDK/BluetoothLibrary.framework/
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
SDK/SDK/BluetoothLibrary.framework/BluetoothLibrary
SDK/SDK/BluetoothLibrary.framework/_CodeSignature/
SDK/coolwearsdkdemo-main 6/sdkdemo/Lib/BluetoothLibrary.framework/BluetoothLibrary
SDK/coolwearsdkdemo-main 6/sdkdemo/Lib/BluetoothLibrary.framework/_CodeSignature/
SDK/coolwearsdkdemo-main 6/sdkdemo/BluetoothLibrary.framework/
SDK/coolwearsdkdemo-main 6/sdkdemo/BluetoothLibrary.framework

